WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.450
Step four connects.

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:05.947
The tool signs in separately to
Microsoft Graph, Azure, Exchange Online,

3
00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:10.977
Security and Compliance, SharePoint
Online and Azure Information Protection,

4
00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.950
and a Graph connection
doesn't grant the others.

5
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:19.576
Learn's get-started page shows only the
commercial command, which G C C also uses,

6
00:00:19.576 --> 00:00:24.337
because G C C uses the worldwide
endpoints: the Global environment.

7
00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:29.837
Then confirm the tenant and cloud with
Get M G Context and Get A Z Context.

8
00:00:29.837 --> 00:00:32.741
Pass the SharePoint
admin U R L explicitly,

9
00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:36.475
or the tool infers one from
the tenant's initial domain.

10
00:00:36.475 --> 00:00:39.624
If a service won't connect,
connect the rest, run,

11
00:00:39.624 --> 00:00:43.920
and record its tests as skipped,
disconnected, with the reason.
